        (
            name: "get-transcript",
            description: Some("Retrieves a transcript of the session, including details about any attachments. For information about accessing past chat contact transcripts for a persistent chat, see Enable persistent chat.  If you have a process that consumes events in the transcript of an chat that has ended, note that chat transcripts contain the following event content types if the event has occurred during the chat session:    application/vnd.amazonaws.connect.event.participant.left     application/vnd.amazonaws.connect.event.participant.joined     application/vnd.amazonaws.connect.event.chat.ended     application/vnd.amazonaws.connect.event.transfer.succeeded     application/vnd.amazonaws.connect.event.transfer.failed      ConnectionToken is used for invoking this API instead of ParticipantToken.  The Amazon Connect Participant Service APIs do not use Signature Version 4 authentication"),
            options: [
